(0.2.1) To build up statistical capacity. 
(0.2.1) To upgrade and modernize OPS’s IT systems. 
 
9.3 Financial Plans for improvement - TA/financing needs - Short-term 
 
Office of Planning and Statistics 
Assistance from the Asian Development Bank (ADB) and Secretariat of Pacific Community (SPC) 
required for the plans mentioned above. 
 

